{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:6377129d180e0725","name":"3rd-Degree Droid Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-6377129d180e0725","title":"3rd-Degree Droid Talent Tree","revision":19386,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:51:35Z","sha256":"b1eecd1e96e49159a406cd0b8484c0de58c478954cb2d5d2d54b641661b841d7","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19386","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=3rd-Degree%20Droid%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-6377129d180e0725","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["3rd-Degree Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/3rd-Degree_Droids","referenceId":"reference:75702a16c64c3380"}," are typically Protocol Droids and Replica Droids. Only they can select Talents from this Droid Talent Tree. \n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Etiquette"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["When you succeed on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check to change a character's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"},", you adjust the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," by one additional step.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Helpful in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Helpful"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Helpful"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Helpful Droid"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn you can use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action to assist any adjacent ally on a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Protocol"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You always succeed on attempts to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge","referenceId":"reference:dcb3e1c00e79236d"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," checks (no roll required).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Additional Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Nuanced"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled in the nuances of diplomatic speech and gestures. Once per encounter, you can add your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," bonus to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check in addition to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"}," bonus.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Observant"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You enhance your persuasiveness by applying data obtained through observation. Whenever you would fail a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check, you can roll a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},", with a DC equal to the DC of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check. If you succeed, add +5 to the original ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check result.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Supervising Droid"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Observant"]},", Any Talent from the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Influence Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Influence_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:c995726a33a2e905"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Inspiration Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Inspiration_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:066f065bb50f22ec"},", or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Leadership Talent Tree"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Leadership_Talent_Tree","referenceId":"reference:a51a0918ead13923"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are programmed to oversee other Droids. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Combat Support"]},": As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you automatically ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," on an allied Droid's attack roll, provided you are capable of using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action to assist that ally. If you also have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Focus","referenceId":"reference:393613c18e211d0f"}," feat, you increase the bonus provided by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action from +2 to +3."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Director"]},": As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you automatically ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Droid with a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in. If you also have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus","referenceId":"reference:453339c8a3cf4f4c"}," in that skill, you increase the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," bonus from +2 to +5."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Instant Action"]},": As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you grant one ally a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," that it can use immediately as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},"."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Talkdroid"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You know how to subtly massage translations. When one of your allies is attempting to use the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," skill to change the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Attitude"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Attitude"}," of a creature that does not understand your ally, you add +2 to the ally's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check results if you perform the translation.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
